   "caption": {
    "text": "Meltdown Mayhem: A Double-Header Patty Event\nTwo days, two locations, one very melty celebration.\n\nSUNDAY NIGHT MELTDOWN kicks off at @maydayvt with the $10 patty meltdown you know and love. This time, we’re celebrating the tapping of Road to Joy, a collab beer between @foambrewers and May Day. A Shirley Temple-inspired sour that hits all the right notes of lemon + lime soda and pomegranate with just a kiss of tart cherry. Some of the Foam crew will be there to raise a glass to the collaboration.\n\nStop by for a glass and a melt, but don’t get too full, because the meltdown continues on Monday.\n\nA VERY SPECIAL MONDAY MELTDOWN at Foam Brewers as the May Day crew takes over the Deep City kitchen to do their thing, making melts for the people of 112 Lake Street starting at 5:30 PM and serving until they sell out. And we don’t expect that to take long. The same patty melts you know and love, just at Foam.\n\nWe better see you, or the pattys won’t be the only thing melting down."
